{"version":1,"content":"<p>走過11年音樂路，黃淑蔓（Feanna）即將首次踏上個人演唱會舞台，以歌曲重溫成長與失戀的片段。</p><p>事業迎來新一頁，她內心卻仍有一份虧欠︰家人多年來支持她追夢，她至今未能如願分擔家計，盼往後以行動回報。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:45:28.210529+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:01:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:27.435887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:24.046094+00:00","content_hash":"0ae4d1f7dbffaff2c2bb26b56e0de23b91860b367d684e3127d1d95de359664b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}